Method note: the sandbox blocks shell redirects, temp-file writes, `2>&1`, `NR>1` in awk, `!`
and `>` inside patterns, and `PIPESTATUS`, so each spec command runs as an equivalent stdin/pipe
form with identical values. Equivalences are named per gate. The restart check blocks extract by
exact line range because example awk commands above each marker would contaminate a name-based
extraction (the first name-based attempt produced wrong SHAs; the line-range slices match the
table).

